# Ignore embedded git repos to prevent accidental submodule re-addition.
# NOTE: `opensource` (no trailing slash) deliberately matches BOTH the dir and
# a bare `opensource` symlink/file — a directory-only `opensource/` pattern does
# NOT match a symlink (mode 120000) and would let an env-bootstrap symlink get
# committed (see decision 01-implementer-ponytail-test-env).
opensource
emotional_architecture/
